sequenceDiagram
    participant Author as PR author
    participant CLI as PR evidence commands
    participant Trace as spec-pack/spec-cascade/module-headers
    participant Surface as ai-surface-budget
    participant Risk as pr-risk-classify
    participant Evidence as Gate/evidence/dashboard/SARIF
    participant Reviewer as Human reviewer

    Author->>CLI: Run PR-time evidence chain
    CLI->>Trace: Check template contract and requirement/task/source coherence
    CLI->>Surface: Check AI/governance instruction context health
    CLI->>Risk: Classify local diff risk surfaces
    CLI->>Evidence: Generate gate, evidence pack, dashboard, SARIF
    Evidence->>Reviewer: Present findings and limitations
    Reviewer->>Reviewer: Approve PR externally, request fixes, or waive risk
